				"Japanese 2D anime in crisp cel-shaded style, hand-drawn ink outlines,\n   sakuga-quality animation with speed lines and impact frames, warm gold\n   and deep crimson palette over cool blue shadows.\n2. CHARACTER ANCHORS (repeated in every shot they appear):\n   (S1) \"the transfer student with messy black hair, a dark navy school\n        jacket worn open over a white shirt with sleeves rolled up, and\n        white bandages wrapped around both fists\" - power signature:\n        molten crimson flame (his color lock)\n   (S2) \"the top disciple with waist-length straight black hair bound by a\n        gold clasp, a pristine white-and-gold academy uniform, and a wooden\n        practice sword at her hip\" - power signature: pale blue lightning\n        (her color lock)\n   (S3) \"the elderly master with a long white beard and flowing gray\n        training robes\" (scenes 4 and 8 only)\n3. PROP ANCHOR: \"the Five Elements Manuscript, an ancient scroll case carved\n   with glowing jade-green characters\" (third accent color: jade green).\nTracked continuity (re-stated verbatim in every later clip):\n   - from scene 5B onward, (S1)'s jacket is scorched and torn at the right\n     shoulder.\n   - from scene 7B onward, (S2)'s hair flows loose, her gold clasp shattered.\nSpeaker IDs: (S1) = the transfer student (gruff, quiet voice),\n             (S2) = the top disciple (cool, commanding voice),\n             (S3) = the elderly master (deep, slow voice).",
